# The guard on Anthropic and local Ollama embeddings, for when the OpenAI balance is used up (the same switch as the
# showcase's llm-anthropic.env, docs/agent 위임결정기록 DD-4). No secret here: the Anthropic key is read by
# scripts/start-guard.sh from the contexa docs key file and is never printed.
# Use:  set -a; . llm-anthropic.env; set +a; BENCH_TIER=C2 scripts/start-guard.sh
BENCH_CHAT_PROVIDER=anthropic
BENCH_LAYER1_MODEL=claude-haiku-5-5
BENCH_LAYER2_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
BENCH_EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=ollama
BENCH_OLLAMA_EMBEDDING_MODEL=mxbai-embed-large
